{"shortDescription":"Asia's high sulphur fuel oil (HSFO) firmed on Thursday, with the market's cash premium rebounding after paring back in recent sessions, while the 380-cst HSFO/Brent crack flipped from a discount into a premium.Stronger bids emerged for 380-cst HSFO in the physical market, driving the cash premium h…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Asia's high sulphur fuel oil (HSFO) firmed on Thursday, with the market's cash premium rebounding after paring back in recent sessions, while the 380-cst HSFO/Brent crack flipped from a discount into a premium."]},{"type":"p","children":["Stronger bids emerged for 380-cst HSFO in the physical market, driving the cash premium higher day on day to above $44 a metric ton, while the prompt backwardation spread also widened."]},{"type":"p","children":["The 380-cst HSFO/Brent crack (FO380BRTCKMc1) rose to a premium of 93 cents a barrel at the Asia close, LSEG data showed, after hovering in discounts for about a month. The HSFO market has largely been volatile amid supply uncertainties."]},{"type":"p","children":["Meanwhile, the market for very low sulphur fuel oil (VLSFO) softened slightly on Thursday."]},{"type":"p","children":["The product's cash premium dipped slightly from the previous session to below $35 a ton, after its market structure softened. However, its crack (LFO05SGBRTCMc1) edged slightly higher to a premium above $23.50 a barrel."]},{"type":"p","children":["In spot sales, Indonesia's Pertamina offered more low-sulphur waxy residue for loading next month in a tender that closed on Thursday, according to market sources. The cargo is scheduled for loading between October 22 and 23."]},{"type":"p","children":["SINGAPORE DATA"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Singapore's residual fuel stockpiles (STKRS-SIN) fell 1.8% week on week to 19.78 million barrels (3.11 million tons) in the week to September 23, latest data from Enterprise Singapore showed on Thursday."]},{"type":"p","children":["OTHER NEWS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Oil prices rose more than 2% on Thursday as diplomatic talks between the US and Iran showed little sign of progress, while investors focused on uncertainty about a potential US ban on diesel exports."]},{"type":"p","children":["- China will raise retail gasoline and diesel prices following gains in global oil prices but cap the increases to cushion the impact on the domestic market, the National Development and Reform Commission said on Thursday."]},{"type":"p","children":["- US Energy Secretary Chris Wright said a US ban on diesel exports would not work and could push up gasoline and jet fuel prices, putting him at odds with President Donald Trump, who on Tuesday backed the idea as diesel prices have surged to record highs in the US and Europe amid the wars in Iran and Ukraine."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Southeast Asia is developing more than 100 gigawatts of gas-fired power generating capacity and 70 million tons per annum of LNG import capacity, despite growing supply risks highlighted by the ongoing war in the Middle East, data from US think tank Global Energy Monitor showed on Thursday."]},{"type":"p","children":["WINDOW TRADES"]},{"type":"p","children":["- 180-cst HSFO: Two trades."]},{"type":"p","children":["- 380-cst HSFO: No trade."]},{"type":"p","children":["- 0.5% VLSFO: No trade."]},{"type":"p","children":["ASSESSMENTS"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["FUEL OIL"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["CASH ($/T)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["ASIA CLOSE"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["CHAN